# Raw Knowledge Inbox

Purpose:
- store unprocessed notes, transcripts, exports, pasted research, and handoff material
- keep source material intact until it is distilled into the curated wiki
- make future agents able to trace durable knowledge back to source material

Rules:
- Do not treat raw notes as canonical.
- Prefer dated filenames: `YYYY-MM-DD-topic.md`.
- Keep each file focused on one source, session, meeting, issue, or investigation.
- Move distilled facts into `../{{KNOWLEDGE_WIKI_DIR}}/index.md`, decisions, architecture notes, task history, or agent lessons.
- Link back to raw source files when the source matters.

Suggested note shape:

```md
# YYYY-MM-DD Topic

Source:
Captured by:
Related task:
Status: raw

## Notes

## Follow-ups
```
